# No accent edge bars on cards

Never use thick colored accent bars on cards, metric tiles, or panels — neither on the left edge nor along the top edge.

Avoid patterns such as:
- `border-l-4 border-l-primary` / `border-l-sky-500` (left accent stripe)
- A solid colored top strip (`h-1.5 bg-teal-700`, `border-t-4 border-t-primary`, full-bleed PDF header bars used only as decoration)

Prefer uniform borders (`border border-border`), soft background tints, or illustrations for differentiation instead.
